{"version":1,"content":"<p>由兩代金馬影后袁澧林與張艾嘉主演的電影《二十四味》在內地上映，袁澧林前晚於廣州出席首映，花了不少時間揣摩角色的她大談拍攝感受！</p><p>而郭富城新作亦於同一檔期上映，他跟戲中小男孩甚為投契，盡顯慈父本色！</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;近</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T16:24:43.147966+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T16:01:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T16:17:34.758301+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T16:17:34.758301+00:00","content_hash":"99104f4c068d0417d8fc0bc1defe705ca27ae1a3961260be56f1d58b48521396","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}